{"guid":"grp-79-77","timestamp_unix_ms":1784304019055,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Your father was gone, your uncle at home, and, as I said before, they had a great deal of talk together. Gardiner went away in all the perplexity about Elizabeth and her Derbyshire friend, that had attended her from that part of the world.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
